    &longitude=-46.40
    &hourly=wave_height,wave_period,wave_direction,swell_wave_height,swell_wave_period
```

Fluxo:

```text
Marine API
    ↓
Ocean Connector
    ↓
Bronze
    ↓
Ocean Canonical Mapper
    ↓
ocean_observation
```

